WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.794
Daisuke!

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:03.962
Milo!

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:07.966
Daisuke, do it!

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:08.967
All right!

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.192
I'm sorry for leaving my post.

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:27.318
The others are in danger.

00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:28.319
What?

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.530
They may be able to fight it off
with the String Puppets.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:37.829
I'll die in the line of duty.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.674
Activation confirmed.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:51.843
Who are the pilots?

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.512
Lu and I are piloting.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.097
Can you both handle it?

00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:57.599
-Well...
-We'll try!

00:00:57.682 --> 00:01:00.018
It might be too much
for rookies to handle.

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:01.686
I'm on my way to help you out!

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:10.528
Will those two be okay?

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:14.532
I've arrived!

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:25.085
All right, I'll finish it off!

00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:27.879
Don't move. Stay out of the line of fire.

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:32.425
Adjust to the right, 2.4 degrees.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:35.053
Got it. Right, 2.4 degrees.

00:01:38.973 --> 00:01:40.391
-Gai!
-Right!

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:47.482
Yes!

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:48.900
These guys...

00:01:49.984 --> 00:01:51.903
They can already pilot them this well?

